  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "\"Yura Town\" was once prosperous ",
      "but it was hurted with both barren surroundings ",
      "and attacks of IronFists.",
      "As a result most of the residents emigrated ",
      "from Yura to Ricalaten or Philly,",
      "then some rest of residents lost their lives.",
      "It's hard to keep the Yura anymore due to ",
      "insufficient supplies of military.",
      "We don't know when IronFists will attack Yura",
      "So we resist IronFists for asking some brave ",
      "worriors to suppress them.",
      "",
      "May I ask a favor to hunt ten IronFists?",
      "I'll give you a special sheltom on behalf of",
      "the town, if you come back. "
    ]
  },
